@host = http://localhost:5297
@packageHash = replace-with-1.1.0-contentHash
@sessionId = replace-after-create
@supplierTeamId = replace-after-add
@carrierTeamId = replace-after-add
@supplierEntityId = replace-after-create
@carrierEntityId = replace-after-create
@creditProviderEntityId = replace-after-create
@supplierPairingCode = replace-after-add
@carrierPairingCode = replace-after-add
@supplierToken = replace-after-pair
@carrierToken = replace-after-pair
@adminToken = deployment-provisioned-admin-token-for-session
@supplierAssignmentId = replace-from-supplier-experience
@carrierAssignmentId = replace-from-carrier-experience
@proposalId = replace-after-send
@secondProposalId = replace-after-send
@stateVersion = replace-with-latest-response-version

### 1. Both immutable Package versions must be listed
GET {{host}}/api/story-packages

###
GET {{host}}/api/story-packages/sample-cargo-delay/1.0.0

###
GET {{host}}/api/story-packages/sample-cargo-delay/1.1.0

### 2. Create a Standard 1.1.0 Session
POST {{host}}/api/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{"storyPackageId":"sample-cargo-delay","storyVersion":"1.1.0","contentHash":"{{packageHash}}","seed":42,"difficultyId":"standard","expectedVersion":0}

### 3. Add Supplier and Carrier Teams
POST {{host}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/teams
Content-Type: application/json

{"displayName":"تیم تامین‌کننده","expectedVersion":1}

###
POST {{host}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/teams
Content-Type: application/json

{"displayName":"تیم حمل‌کننده","expectedVersion":2}

### 4. Add two human Entities and authored Credit Provider
POST {{host}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/entities
Content-Type: application/json

{"definitionId":"supplier","displayName":"تامین‌کننده","controllerType":"HumanTeam","behaviorProfileId":null,"expectedVersion":3}

###
POST {{host}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/entities
Content-Type: application/json

{"definitionId":"carrier","displayName":"حمل‌کننده","controllerType":"HumanTeam","behaviorProfileId":null,"expectedVersion":4}

###
POST {{host}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/entities
Content-Type: application/json

{"definitionId":"credit-provider","displayName":"تامین‌کننده اعتبار","controllerType":"AuthoredBehavior","behaviorProfileId":"cooperative-credit","expectedVersion":5}

### 5. Assign human Entities
POST {{host}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/assignments
Content-Type: application/json

{"entityId":"{{supplierEntityId}}","teamId":"{{supplierTeamId}}","expectedVersion":6}

###
POST {{host}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/assignments
Content-Type: application/json

{"entityId":"{{carrierEntityId}}","teamId":"{{carrierTeamId}}","expectedVersion":7}

### 6. Start and initialize
POST {{host}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/start
Content-Type: application/json

{"expectedVersion":8}

###
POST {{host}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/narrative/initialize
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"expectedStateVersion":9,"commandId":"81000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001"}

### 7. Pair Teams and copy JWTs
POST {{host}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/pair
Content-Type: application/json

{"teamId":"{{supplierTeamId}}","pairingCode":"{{supplierPairingCode}}"}

###
POST {{host}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/pair
Content-Type: application/json

{"teamId":"{{carrierTeamId}}","pairingCode":"{{carrierPairingCode}}"}

### 8. Read isolated Storylets and submit initial Choices
GET {{host}}/api/story/experience
Authorization: Bearer {{supplierToken}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/story/experience
Authorization: Bearer {{carrierToken}}

###
POST {{host}}/api/story/choices
Authorization: Bearer {{supplierToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"assignmentId":"{{supplierAssignmentId}}","choiceId":"promise-original-deadline","expectedStateVersion":{{stateVersion}},"commandId":"82000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001"}

###
POST {{host}}/api/story/choices
Authorization: Bearer {{carrierToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"assignmentId":"{{carrierAssignmentId}}","choiceId":"reserve-emergency-capacity","expectedStateVersion":{{stateVersion}},"commandId":"82000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002"}

### 9. Supplier sends, Carrier reads inbox and counters
POST {{host}}/api/proposals
Authorization: Bearer {{supplierToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"interactionTypeId":"emergency-capacity-support","receiverTeamId":"{{carrierTeamId}}","termsPayload":{"capacityUnits":8,"supportDurationCheckpoints":1,"publicDisclosure":true,"note":"پشتیبانی فوری"},"validityType":null,"validForCheckpointCount":null,"validUntilCheckpointId":null,"expectedStateVersion":{{stateVersion}},"commandId":"84000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001"}

###
GET {{host}}/api/proposals/inbox
Authorization: Bearer {{carrierToken}}

###
POST {{host}}/api/proposals/{{proposalId}}/counter
Authorization: Bearer {{carrierToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"expectedRevisionNumber":1,"termsPayload":{"capacityUnits":12,"supportDurationCheckpoints":2,"publicDisclosure":false},"expectedStateVersion":{{stateVersion}},"commandId":"84000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002"}

### 10. Supplier sees revision 2 and accepts
GET {{host}}/api/proposals/inbox
Authorization: Bearer {{supplierToken}}

###
POST {{host}}/api/proposals/{{proposalId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{supplierToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"expectedRevisionNumber":2,"expectedStateVersion":{{stateVersion}},"commandId":"84000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003"}

### 11. Send second unanswered Proposal
POST {{host}}/api/proposals
Authorization: Bearer {{supplierToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"interactionTypeId":"emergency-capacity-support","receiverTeamId":"{{carrierTeamId}}","termsPayload":{"capacityUnits":3,"supportDurationCheckpoints":1,"publicDisclosure":false},"validityType":null,"validForCheckpointCount":null,"validUntilCheckpointId":null,"expectedStateVersion":{{stateVersion}},"commandId":"84000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004"}

### 12. First resolution expires Proposal, executes Agreement, resolves Behavior and schedules Consequence
POST {{host}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/narrative/resolve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"expectedStateVersion":{{stateVersion}},"commandId":"85000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001"}

### Admin replayable state: expiration, Agreement, Behavior selection and pending Consequence
GET {{host}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/agreements
Authorization: Bearer {{supplierToken}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/story/experience
Authorization: Bearer {{supplierToken}}

### 13. Second resolution triggers deadline consequence and reaches coordination-result
POST {{host}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/narrative/resolve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"expectedStateVersion":{{stateVersion}},"commandId":"85000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002"}

### 14. Public/private projections and health
GET {{host}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/public

###
GET {{host}}/api/story/experience
Authorization: Bearer {{carrierToken}}

###
GET {{host}}/health

###
GET {{host}}/alive

###
GET {{host}}/ready
